MemoLine is built on Tendedero
===============================

The interaction — screenshots hung on a clothesline above the macOS menu bar,
the rope, the aluminium clips, the sway in the breeze, and the reveal-and-
retract behaviour — comes from Tendedero:

    https://github.com/alejandrobujan/tendedero
    Copyright (c) 2026 Alejandro Buján
    MIT licensed

MemoLine was built on top of that work. Parts of the source (the rope, the
line's layout, the panel and shortcut plumbing) are derived from it.

Tendedero's licence covers its source code only: it grants no rights to the
Tendedero name or its icon. MemoLine therefore carries its own name and its
own icon, and is not affiliated with Tendedero or endorsed by its author.
